{
  "uid": "lab-circuit-fault",
  "title": "Lab: WAN circuit fault + inhibit",
  "tags": [
    "lab",
    "circuit",
    "inhibit",
    "alloy"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 0,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How this board works",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**WAN circuit fault + notification inhibit**\n\nUse the **Toggle** links (they open the webhook, then bounce back here). Infinity polls admin-state. All SNMP panels and circuit-demo alerts are Alloy `snmp_*` (`job=\"alloy-snmp\"`) \u2014 parent iface-down inhibits child BGP (`role=circuit_child`, same `circuit_id`). Webhook `https://2fpzuws2aa.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Toggle circuits",
      "description": "GET to the token-gated webhook (HTTPS). Disable = admin-down on the catalogued WAN port.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "html",
        "content": "<p><b>Click a link to toggle the WAN port</b> (new tab, then redirect back).</p>\n<p><b>WAN-HQ-BR1</b> \u2014 spine1 ethernet-1/3 \u2192 leaf-br1 ethernet-1/49 &nbsp; <a href=\"https://2fpzuws2aa.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/v1/circuits/WAN-HQ-BR1?admin_state=disable&token=__LAB_FAULT_TOKEN__&redirect=1\">Disable</a> &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp; <a href=\"https://2fpzuws2aa.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/v1/circuits/WAN-HQ-BR1?admin_state=enable&token=__LAB_FAULT_TOKEN__&redirect=1\">Enable</a></p>\n<p><b>WAN-HQ-BR2</b> \u2014 spine1 ethernet-1/4 \u2192 leaf-br2 ethernet-1/49 &nbsp; <a href=\"https://2fpzuws2aa.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/v1/circuits/WAN-HQ-BR2?admin_state=disable&token=__LAB_FAULT_TOKEN__&redirect=1\">Disable</a> &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp; <a href=\"https://2fpzuws2aa.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/v1/circuits/WAN-HQ-BR2?admin_state=enable&token=__LAB_FAULT_TOKEN__&redirect=1\">Enable</a></p>"
      },
      "links": [
        {
          "title": "Disable WAN-HQ-BR1",
          "url": "https://2fpzuws2aa.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/v1/circuits/WAN-HQ-BR1?admin_state=disable&token=__LAB_FAULT_TOKEN__&redirect=1",
          "targetBlank": true
        },
        {
          "title": "Disable WAN-HQ-BR2",
          "url": "https://2fpzuws2aa.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/v1/circuits/WAN-HQ-BR2?admin_state=disable&token=__LAB_FAULT_TOKEN__&redirect=1",
          "targetBlank": true
        },
        {
          "title": "Enable WAN-HQ-BR1",
          "url": "https://2fpzuws2aa.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/v1/circuits/WAN-HQ-BR1?admin_state=enable&token=__LAB_FAULT_TOKEN__&redirect=1",
          "targetBlank": true
        },
        {
          "title": "Enable WAN-HQ-BR2",
          "url": "https://2fpzuws2aa.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/v1/circuits/WAN-HQ-BR2?admin_state=enable&token=__LAB_FAULT_TOKEN__&redirect=1",
          "targetBlank": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Circuit admin-state (webhook)",
      "description": "Infinity GET /v1/circuits via Grafana Cloud proxy",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
        "uid": "lab-fault-webhook"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
            "uid": "lab-fault-webhook"
          },
          "type": "json",
          "source": "url",
          "url": "/v1/circuits",
          "url_options": {
            "method": "GET",
            "data": ""
          },
          "format": "table",
          "parser": "backend",
          "root_selector": "circuits",
          "columns": [
            {
              "selector": "circuit_id",
              "text": "circuit_id",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "admin_state",
              "text": "admin_state",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "node",
              "text": "node",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "iface",
              "text": "iface",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "selector": "description",
              "text": "description",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "alertlist",
      "title": "Circuit-demo alerts",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "viewMode": "list",
        "groupMode": "default",
        "alertName": "",
        "alertInstanceLabelFilter": "demo=circuit-inhibit",
        "stateFilter": {
          "firing": true,
          "pending": true,
          "noData": false,
          "normal": false,
          "error": true
        },
        "maxItems": 20,
        "sortOrder": 1,
        "dashboardAlerts": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "WAN-HQ-BR1 oper-state",
      "description": "1=up, 2=down. Links also in the Toggle circuits panel above.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "grafanacloud-prom"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "2": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Disable WAN-HQ-BR1",
              "url": "https://2fpzuws2aa.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/v1/circuits/WAN-HQ-BR1?admin_state=disable&token=__LAB_FAULT_TOKEN__&redirect=1",
              "targetBlank": true
            },
            {
              "title": "Enable WAN-HQ-BR1",
              "url": "https://2fpzuws2aa.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/v1/circuits/WAN-HQ-BR1?admin_state=enable&token=__LAB_FAULT_TOKEN__&redirect=1",
              "targetBlank": true
            }
          ],
          "actions": [
            {
              "type": "http-request",
              "title": "Disable WAN-HQ-BR1",
              "options": {
                "url": "https://2fpzuws2aa.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/v1/circuits/WAN-HQ-BR1",
                "method": "POST",
                "body": "{\"admin_state\":\"disable\"}",
                "headers": [
                  {
                    "key": "Authorization",
                    "value": "Bearer __LAB_FAULT_TOKEN__"
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "http-request",
              "title": "Enable WAN-HQ-BR1",
              "options": {
                "url": "https://2fpzuws2aa.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/v1/circuits/WAN-HQ-BR1",
                "method": "POST",
                "body": "{\"admin_state\":\"enable\"}",
                "headers": [
                  {
                    "key": "Authorization",
                    "value": "Bearer __LAB_FAULT_TOKEN__"
                  },
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "grafanacloud-prom"
          },
          "expr": "snmp_ifOperStatus{job=\"alloy-snmp\",device_name=\"spine1\",if_interface_name=\"ethernet-1/3\"} or snmp_ifOperStatus{job=\"alloy-snmp\",device_name=\"spine1\",if_interface_name=\"ethernet-1/3.0\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{if_interface_name}}",
          "instant": false,
          "range": true,
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
